      "writtenOn": "2025-03-06T17:02:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Of course. Looking at `EffectHelper`, it actually needs some updates. It has started as a class with static member functions only, but now it has got some fields:\n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:hardware/interfaces/audio/aidl/vts/EffectHelper.h;l\u003d606;drc\u003d903c62041c5e017cebad74ee641d55e82b569062\n```\n    bool mIsSpatializer;\n    Descriptor mDescriptor;\n    size_t mInputFrameSize, mOutputFrameSize;\n    size_t mInputSamples, mOutputSamples;\n```\n\nAnd it lacks a proper constructor. I would suggest adding one, which takes the `Descriptor` as a parameter. It\u0027s not a good pattern to initialize the field of a parent class in a child class. And the remaining fields should have default values.\n\nI think this should be done as a separate CL because changing `EffectHelper` will affect other test classes that inherit from it.",
